    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="18">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 18</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{LXII} Cierlisc mon gif he óft betygen wære: gif he æt siðestan sie gefongen, slea mon hond [of] oððe fot.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">A man of ceorl rank who has often been accused: if he is finally caught [in the act], let his hand or foot be struck off.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a commoner, who has often been accused, is at last caught [in the act], his hand or foot shall be cut off.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ciorlisc mon gif he óft betogen wære, gif he æt siðestan sí gefongen, slea mon hond of oððe fot.</ab>
      </div>
